# Each face: 23 characters - its 1st corner (x, height, z; cm + 376785, 3 characters each), the 2nd and 3rd corners from
# the 1st (cm + 4140, 2 characters each), the object's name (2 characters); base 91 (the characters of ALPHA).
# CELLS: the faces in each 2 m square of the map (x // 2, z // 2), 3 characters each.
